        <div class="cav">Let's read the numbers properly</div>
        <h1>Is AI a Threat to Humanity? <em>What the Numbers Mean</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">Every headline percentage about AI killing everyone is a number somebody wrote down when asked, not a number anybody measured. Here is the difference between the two, what the labs have actually tested, and how to read the next scary figure you see.</p>
        <div class="byline"><span><b>Best Answer Hub</b></span><span>~14 min read</span><span>Every figure sourced</span><span>No signup</span></div>
